    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The model's response cut off mid-sentence. Could you finish that thought? Also, regarding that \"burden of proof\" part—if the disruption feels almost like an act of chaos rather than a predictable business risk, how do courts view those kinds of unpredictable, almost malicious-feeling interruptions to a stable system?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
